e and areola  RSS  1 frag   Micro 7   lower outer quadrant nodules  RSS  1 frag   Micro 8   more lower outer quadrant slightly granular and nodular areas   RSS  1 frag   Micro 9   upper outer quadrant  RSS  1 frag   Micro 10   lower inner quadrant  RSS  1 frag   Micro 11   upper inner quadrant  RSS  1 frag   Reports to  SHOJI  BRENT  T  M D   SPECIMEN TYPE  SIMPLE MASTECTOMY   report_end  , No.
