 x 0 2cm to REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm which are submitted in toto as cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Final Diagnosis by Melinda J Lerwill M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART   Breast  Left   Core biopsy  report_end  , Yes.
